r (parse/topology/audit) only parses the board text, lists chains, liberties and regions, and checks the legality and captures of the single move the player named; the other commands were play calls, file reads/writes, a replay-to-SGF check, and notes. No code looped over empty points to score moves or looked ahead along continuations.", "stop": false}}